  "answer": "In the RAG paper, the difference between RAG-Sequence and RAG-Token is:\n\n- **RAG-Sequence:** Uses the same retrieved document to predict all target tokens in the sequence, treating the retrieved document as a single latent variable [rag_lewis_2020.pdf p.3].\n- **RAG-Token:** Can draw a different latent document for each individual target token, allowing the generator to combine content from several documents when producing an answer [rag_lewis_2020.pdf p.3].",
